      "summary": "The identity and registry checks cover the requested configurations, but the root output set contradicts AC RELEASE-ID-04 and the Terraform test codifies that mismatch.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "infra/terraform/release-identity.tf",
          "line": 108,
          "message": "Remove the two identity client ID root outputs or otherwise meet AC RELEASE-ID-04's exact output-name set; the current implementation and test permit five root outputs instead of the required three.",
          "confidence": 0.99,
          "category": "logic-error",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The Terraform root adds build_identity_client_id and release_identity_client_id outputs here and at line 113. AC RELEASE-ID-04 requires the complete root output set to be exactly model_endpoint, app_sql_grant_statements, and migration_sql_grant_statements; the changed Terraform test instead requires five outputs at release-identity.tftest.hcl:438.",
            "failureScenario": "After apply, querying the root outputs returns two extra identity client ID values, and the test passes while enforcing the wrong five-output contract. This violates AC RELEASE-ID-04's exact three-name output set."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
