      "summary": "The identity and registry tests cover many of the requested constraints. The output test does not enforce AC RELEASE-ID-04’s exact output set or values.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "infra/terraform/tests/release-identity.tftest.hcl",
          "line": 438,
          "message": "AC RELEASE-ID-04 is not enforced: assert the exact three output names and exact evaluated values for all three outputs. The current check can pass with changed SQL grants and permits two outputs the criterion excludes.",
          "confidence": 0.99,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The release_outputs_contain_no_secrets run checks that there are five outputs and scans their serialized values for secret-like text. It does not assert the required three-name set or compare the SQL grant outputs with their exact expected values.",
            "failureScenario": "If an SQL grant statement is removed or changed while the output remains non-secret, this assertion still passes. It also permits the two workflow client ID outputs even though AC RELEASE-ID-04 requires exactly model_endpoint, app_sql_grant_statements, and migration_sql_grant_statements."
          }
        }
